faq:
  heading: "Frequently Asked Questions"
  items:
    - question: How can I read customer reviews for S. Phaneuf & Associates?
      answer: >
        You can read customer reviews and testimonials from homeowners and businesses who have worked with S. Phaneuf & Associates on masonry, hardscaping, asphalt paving, excavation, site development, and other construction projects. Our reviews provide insight into the quality of our workmanship, communication, professionalism, and overall project experience.

    - question: What types of projects do customers review?
      answer: >
        Our customer reviews cover a variety of residential and commercial projects, including custom patios, outdoor living spaces, fire pits, retaining walls, masonry and hardscaping, asphalt paving, excavation, site development, and other property improvements. The projects featured in our reviews reflect the range of construction services we provide throughout Massachusetts.

    - question: Do you work with both residential and commercial customers?
      answer: >
        Yes. S. Phaneuf & Associates works with both residential and commercial customers throughout Massachusetts. Our experience includes residential outdoor living and masonry projects as well as commercial paving, site development, excavation, property improvements, and snow and ice management.

    - question: Where are your customers located?
      answer: >
        Our customers are located throughout Massachusetts, including communities in Greater Boston and Central and Eastern Massachusetts. We have completed projects in communities such as Concord, Holliston, Wellesley, Weston, Acton, Bolton, Carlisle, Lexington, Littleton, Sudbury, Wayland, and Westford. Visit our <a href="/service-areas">Service Areas</a> page to learn more about the communities we serve.

    - question: How can I learn more about a project mentioned in a review?
      answer: >
        Our portfolio includes examples of completed masonry, hardscaping, asphalt paving, excavation, and site development projects. You can explore our <a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a> to see additional project examples, or visit the service page related to the type of project you're interested in.

    - question: How can I contact S. Phaneuf & Associates about a similar project?
      answer: >
        If you're considering a project similar to one featured in our reviews, contact S. Phaneuf & Associates to discuss your goals and property. You can <a href="/contact-us">contact us</a> by phone, email, or through our online form to request a free consultation and estimate.

