            <h2 class="pipe">See What Our Massachusetts Customers Have to Say</h2>

            <p class="pt-4">
                Choosing a contractor for your property is an important decision. Customer reviews provide valuable insight into what it's like to work with S. Phaneuf & Associates, from the initial consultation through project completion.
            </p>

            <p class="pt-4">
                Our customer reviews highlight the qualities that matter most when planning a construction or outdoor improvement project, including <strong>communication, workmanship, professionalism, reliability, and attention to detail</strong>. They also provide examples of the residential and commercial projects we've completed throughout Massachusetts.
            </p>        

            <p class="pt-4">
